  "details": "We need a secure means of buying and selling avatars. \n\nPeople are being scammed by buying/selling outside of vrchat.\n\nA secure means of distributing avatars and worlds would be to offer an in game purchasing and selling system for avatars and worlds that will allow users to purchase private avatars that are put up for sale, and access them on the unity and/or blender depending on the security level of the purchase, to make edits as they desire, and also make the purchase private or public depending on the security level of the purchase as well.\n\nGive people the option to auto upload on purchase so they don't need to access the sdk in unity.\n\nAnd then make it against tos to distribute stuff outside of vrchat so that people can hold scammers liable.",
